      'prod_look-in-the-mirror', 'Look in the Mirror', 'look-in-the-mirror', '[]',
      2024, NULL, 'Feature', 'feature',
      'released', 'published', 'oram-co-production', 'An Owas Ray Mwape film — Oram Media Dynamics in association with Owas Films. 2024 feature drama.', 'Look in the Mirror (2024) is a Zambian drama feature directed by Owas Ray Mwape. Official key art credits Oram Media Dynamics in association with Owas Films, and names Owas Ray Mwape and Mutinta Mari above the title. The poster’s split-face composition states the film’s psychological premise without spoilers. Maxwell Mwape is credited as Director of Photography on the billing block. A Lusaka premiere night is widely reported for 5 October 2024.',
      'Bring an independent Zambian feature to a public Lusaka premiere — with studio-grade key art and a clear Oram Media Dynamics / Owas Films identity on the poster.', 'Owas Ray Mwape directed. Key art leans into a low-key, night-city psychological frame rather than a busy cast collage. Billing places Oram Media Dynamics and Owas Films on the same card as the director and leads.', 'Independent feature under Oram Media Dynamics / Owas Films. Public stills beyond the official poster remain limited; premiere and unit photography should be added from the cleared press set when available.',
      'Social and Oram channels promoted the Lusaka premiere. Root-archive premiere photography exists but must be title-verified before gallery use. Until then the media gallery leads with the official poster only.', NULL, '[{"value":"2024","label":"Feature year"},{"value":"Lusaka","label":"Premiere city (reported)"},{"value":"Oram Media Dynamics","label":"Production credit (poster)"}]', '[]',
      'Official poster: Oram Media Dynamics in association with Owas Films — ORAM Media Dynamics Co-Production. Kinorium also lists Owas Crystal Films / Tylenol Studios (noted as conflict).', NULL, NULL, 'Oram Media Dynamics in association with Owas Films', NULL,
      'Oram Media Dynamics / Owas Films', NULL, NULL,
      1, 4, 0, 1,
      'Look in the Mirror', 'An Owas Ray Mwape film — Oram Media Dynamics in association with Owas Films. 2024 feature drama.', NULL, NULL, 0,
      'overview', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-18T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-07-18T00:00:00.000Z'
    );
